  "body": "When i try to setup matrix synapse on local network by configuring server name as machine ipv4 address (static), it is possible only to get access only within the machine. when i try to access from  another machine in the network it gives an error such as  No response from server.\r\n\r\n ``\r\nMy system local ipv4 is 192.168.1.145. \r\nI have configured this ip  as  \"SERVER NAME\" while installing  synapse in  homeserver.yaml file. \r\n``\r\n\r\nuser a/c registration as follows:\r\n\r\n ``\r\nregister_new_matrix_user -c homeserver.yaml http://localhost:8008\r\n``\r\n\r\nif i put home server url as  http://localhost:8008 it works in the same machine, if i put 192.168.1.145:8008 from another machine's riot web UI it reflects no response  from server.\r\n\r\n\r\nI failed to generate SSL certificates for bare IP address, since it works only for domain names. @",
